# Voice models. Hundreds of MB each and never source: a piper .onnx is 60 MB, an RVC
# .pth 55 MB with a .index several times that. They belong wherever the backend keeps
# them -- the configure skill puts them under ~/.local/share -- but a checkout used for
# testing tends to accumulate them, and one distracted `git add .` is all it takes.
models/
*.onnx
*.onnx.json
*.pth
*.index
